        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>for neurocutaneous melanosis, coord with <a href="/record/ui?ui=D008548" class="textLink_MELANOSIS">MELANOSIS</a></dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A group of disorders characterized by ectodermal-based malformations and neoplastic growths in the skin, nervous system, and other organs.</dd>
                </span>
            
